New independent vertical mirroring the produce/خضارنا1 flow end-to-end: DB table
store_dates_live_orders with explicit service_role GRANTs (per the post-migration-74
rule in supabase/migrations/README.md), Moyasar payment activation, affiliate
commission matching, shop presence, direct pay, sales ledger, trial flow, and the
full storefront/desk/ops-plan frontend. Same pricing tiers and mechanics as produce
(1350 SAR/180d, 2500 SAR/360d, free trial) — only branding/copy changed to dates.

Unregistered product for now (no SAIP certificate) — storeSaipRegistry.ts untouched,
same as مطعمنا1/حلانا1's current status.

Deferred to a follow-up: decorative atlas/style-lab preview screens, seasonal
national-day banner config, and the real dates product photography (image paths
are wired but the files themselves don't exist yet).

